'''Maeda Keiji''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] and [[WAVE BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|WAVE BUSTERS]] events. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.9 Update|Version 2.0.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases his health, range, attack rate, and triggers the strengthen ability when his health is below 50% instead of 30%. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

