==Trivia==
*Wargod Keiji received a health boost in [[Version 2.2 Update#Update 2.2.9|Version 2.2.9]]. Prior to this update, his base health was 3,000 instead of 3,800.
*Prior to [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]], Keiji lacked the [[Strengthen]] ability and prior to [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]], it lacked [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]].
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Maeda Keiji was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[The First Vajiras (Removed Combo)|The First Vajiras]].
*[[wikipedia:Maeda Toshimasu|Maeda Keiji]] was the nephew of Maeda Toshiie. Both were historical figures of the Sengoku period of feudal Japan.
*Immortal Keiji is one of the units to have his description rewritten in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], as "immune to Wave attacks" was changed to "Immune to Waves".

